Scanner DSL
Goal
A typed, safe rule language for market scanning.
Example
Daily Trend = Bullish
AND 1H BOS = True
AND 15M Liquidity Sweep = True
AND 5M Displacement = True
AND RVOL > 1.5
AND Price > VWAP
AND Sector Strength > 70
AND Futures OI increasing
Requirements
typed AST
AND/OR/NOT
nested groups
timeframe-aware fields
threshold operators
cross-asset conditions
validation
explainability
versioning
Security
Never execute arbitrary Python generated by an AI or user.
